<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The world and all its joys I leave;</l><l>My life, O Lord, Thou wilt receive;</l><l>Henceforth no more Thyself I’ll grieve,</l><l>My Savior and my God!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O Thou who died on Calvary,</l><l>To save my soul and make me free,</l><l>That I may ever live for Thee</l><l>My Savior and my God!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
